h4. Private favourite groups

A favourite group can be private, in which case only you can see it and its posts do not appear on your public page. Private groups need a Gold account. If you make a private group public, you cannot make it private again unless your account is Gold at the time.

Levels are granted by staff; see [[help:users]]. Your favourites themselves are public; a private favourite group is the way to keep a set to yourself.
